6779736798421", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391837_1116779743465087_4577020336986684046_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ggT4oD8k1TUQ7kNvwHDtVAP&_nc_oc=Adr_iWfgM-n7SObKWZgnokqybywfIIpVvwnA-r9Tx335-Pp7sT8s6jgtbG-BibsIztQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7FWdLlpK0Ntfe6abQJP_e-4GBt9SG6eEGDvXJvH9_pEA&oe=6A119D44"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Table Tennis Star", "keywords": ["VR", "VRTableTennis", "TableTennis", "Sports", "PartyGame"], "long_description": "Play against AI opponents of varying difficulty levels, challenge friends in multiplayer matches, or refine your skills in practice mode. With stunning visuals, responsive mechanics, and an authentic feel, Table Tennis Star brings the excitement of real-world ping pong straight to your headset.\n\nAre you ready to become the ultimate table tennis champion? Grab your paddle and step up to the challenge!\n\n", "short_description": "Step into the virtual arena with Table Tennis Star, the most immersive and realistic VR table tennis experience! Whether you're a casual player or a seasoned pro, this game offers precise paddle control, lifelike ball physics, and engaging gameplay that will keep you coming back for more.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/SharconGames/TableTennis_PrivacyPolicy/blob/main/privacy%20Policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BlackHole Infiverse", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://blackholeinfiverse.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection